# Line endings are left exactly as they are on disk.
#
# Every source file in this project is already LF, consistently, so there is nothing for
# normalisation to fix — and a normalising repository that guesses wrong rewrites files on
# checkout, which turns "I changed one line" into a diff of the whole file. Off is simpler
# and cannot be wrong here.
* -text

# Unreal's assets are binary. Marking them stops git from trying to diff or merge them, which
# it cannot do usefully anyway: the answer to a conflict in a .umap is to pick one side.
*.uasset binary
*.umap   binary
*.upk    binary
*.udk    binary

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.tga  binary
*.bmp  binary
*.psd  binary
*.fbx  binary
*.wav  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.ogg  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
